* sg13g2-pll :: sim/sg13cmos5l-vco-period-jitter (issue #518, Part of #16)
* Calibration stage (same circuit as tb_cal_noise.sp.tmpl -- see that
* header): .ac with a 1 A AC current source injected into the stage output
* node gives |Z_out(f)| directly (v(sout) per 1 A).  The equivalent
* injected-current density is then S_i,eff(f) = S_v(f)/|Z_out(f)|^2 with
* S_v the .noise output density from tb_cal_noise; a flat S_i,eff over the
* jitter band is what licenses modelling the aggregate stage noise as ONE
* white current source at the output node.  RECORD-001 "Calibration".
*
* Template placeholders: the shared set (see tb_bias_op.sp.tmpl).
.lib @PDK_ROOT@/@PDK@/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib @CORNER_MOS@
.lib @PDK_ROOT@/@PDK@/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib @CORNER_RES@
.option scale=1 temp=@TEMP@
.global sub!
.include vco_open.spice
vbiasp vbp 0 dc @VBP@
vbiasn vbn 0 dc @VBN@
vdd vdd 0 dc 3.3
vsub sub! 0 dc 0
xs1 sin1 vbp vbn sout vdd 0 vco_stage
rfb sout sin1 1e12
iz sout 0 dc 0 ac 1
.control
pre_osdi @OSDI@/psp103.osdi
pre_osdi @OSDI@/psp103_nqs.osdi
pre_osdi @OSDI@/mosvar.osdi
pre_osdi @OSDI@/r3_cmc.osdi
ac dec 20 1e5 1e11
set numdgt=15
print frequency v(sout)
.endc
.end
